sequenceDiagram
  actor Licensed user
  participant API as Global API
  participant JR as Jurisdiction Resolver
  participant PR as Pack Registry
  participant FX as Monetary/FX Service
  participant TE as Tax Rule Engine
  participant DB as Fiscal Store

  actor->>API: Submit transaction with seller/buyer/supply/currency facts
  API->>JR: Resolve verified legal entities and registrations
  JR->>PR: Resolve approved effective packs
  alt evidence conflict or pack not production enabled
    PR-->>API: JURISDICTION_UNRESOLVED
    API-->>actor: Fail closed / human review
  else jurisdiction resolved
    PR-->>JR: Pack and rule catalogue versions
    JR-->>API: Immutable jurisdiction context
    API->>FX: Resolve approved rate and exact conversions
    FX-->>API: Original/functional/tax amounts plus rate provenance
    API->>TE: Determine rule using supply facts and effective versions
    alt rule ambiguous or unavailable
      TE-->>API: HUMAN_REVIEW_REQUIRED
      API-->>actor: No guessed tax treatment
    else deterministic rule
      TE-->>API: Tax result, explanation, version and decision hash
      API->>DB: Atomic transaction plus jurisdiction/rule/monetary snapshots
      DB-->>actor: Durable receipt with country and currency metadata
    end
  end
